<!--
    Kuna #926 frame recovery and GH-299 literal-pool entries.
    P1 code/data partition: armframes inventory (default) recovers disconnected
    A32 frames, and aifpoolslide preserves the input after a loaded literal.
    The two authored ELF fixtures have generators beside them. The first keeps
    the existing AIF tail target at 0x1600 while adding its frame caller 0x1500.
    The second puts a loaded MOV-shaped literal before a caller's input copy.
    armframes off omits the frame; aifpoolslide off reproduces the early entry
    and return-zero defect. The defaults recover the frame and preserve a0.
-->
